sequenceDiagram
    actor Merchant as 商家管理员
    participant Page as merchantOrders:MerchantOrders
    participant Admin as merchantAdmin:MerchantAdminService
    participant Index as couponIndex:Map
    participant Order as order:Order
    participant Log as operationLog:OperationLog
    participant Store as store:DemoStore
    Merchant->>Page: 提交 couponCode
    Page->>Admin: verifyCoupon(admin,code)
    Admin->>Index: get(code)
    Index-->>Admin: orderId 或 null
    Admin->>Store: 查询订单并校验商家、类型、状态
    alt PAID 且 merchantId 匹配
        Admin->>Order: status=USED
        Admin->>Store: 保存状态和核销时间
        Store->>Log: 记录核销操作
        Store-->>Page: USED
    else null、非 PAID、已 USED 或跨商家
        Admin-->>Page: BusinessException
        Note over Order,Store: 订单状态与核销时间不变
    end
